WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-06 - Through the Static
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Our Own Frequency (2008)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.447
[Instrumental Intro — Gentle Acoustic Fingerpicking & Haunting Piano Melody]

00:00:13.447 --> 00:00:17.350
There's a hundred thousand voices in this room

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:26.800
A tidal wave of flashing lights and gloom

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:33.000
The industry is screaming in my ear

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:38.068
Telling me the things I ought to fear

00:00:42.389 --> 00:00:46.472
I can see the tension in your jaw

00:00:46.552 --> 00:00:50.800
I can read the writing on the wall

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:53.800
You don't have to say a single word

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:56.700
I hear everything that goes unheard

00:00:56.759 --> 00:00:59.721
We can hear each other through the static

00:00:59.761 --> 00:01:03.824
A signal cutting clear across the noise

00:01:03.924 --> 00:01:07.966
When the world around us gets erratic

00:01:07.986 --> 00:01:11.909
We just listen for the other's voice

00:01:11.909 --> 00:01:16.500
Our own frequency, steady and true

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:20.410
I'm always tuned in to you

00:01:20.410 --> 00:01:34.666
[Instrumental Interlude — Intertwining Acoustic Guitar & Piano Heartbeat]

00:01:34.666 --> 00:01:37.868
When the pain is sharp and breathing's slow

00:01:37.988 --> 00:01:41.891
You're the only one who seems to know

00:01:41.971 --> 00:01:45.800
A silent conversation in the dark

00:01:45.800 --> 00:01:49.500
I feel the little changes in your spark

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.200
A subtle shift, a shadow in your eye

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.680
I'll be there before you have to try

00:02:00.651 --> 00:02:03.912
We can hear each other through the static

00:02:04.012 --> 00:02:08.133
A signal cutting clear across the noise

00:02:08.233 --> 00:02:12.294
When the world around us gets erratic

00:02:12.334 --> 00:02:16.200
We just listen for the other's voice

00:02:16.200 --> 00:02:20.500
Our own frequency, steady and true

00:02:20.500 --> 00:02:25.038
I'm always tuned in to you

00:02:27.842 --> 00:02:31.443
Let the cameras flash, let the critics speak

00:02:31.503 --> 00:02:35.825
Let the record spin until it's weak

00:02:35.945 --> 00:02:39.500
They can have the fame and all the gold

00:02:39.500 --> 00:02:42.328
We have a connection they can't hold

00:02:44.909 --> 00:02:48.500
Through the static...

00:02:48.500 --> 00:02:52.500
Just you and me.

00:02:52.500 --> 00:02:56.053
Tuned in perfectly.

00:02:56.053 --> 00:03:17.000
[Outro — Acoustic Guitar Fading into Silence]
